{"id":"sen_ora","lemma":"señora","pos":"noun","rank":221,"glosses":["Ms; a title or form of address for a woman; formerly for a married, divorced, or widowed woman and now commonly for any adult woman regardless of marital status, depending on the region","lady","wife"],"ipa":"/seˈɲoɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"señoras","masculine":"señor","masculinePlural":"señores"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/31/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-se%C3%B1ora.wav","formAudio":{"señor":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-se%C3%B1or.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Detén a esa señora.","en":"Stop that woman.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/424959"},{"text":"\"¿Las bebidas son gratis?\" \"Solo para las señoras.\"","en":"\"Are the drinks free?\" \"Only for ladies.\""},{"text":"Puede irse ahora, señor.","en":"You can go now, sir.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453560"},{"text":"Ve con estos señores.","en":"Go with these men.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443361"},{"text":"No conozco a esa señora.","en":"I don't know that lady.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/630072"}]}